The Eye is the power the four devils [[Divinity/Fiends/Sigzil Haight|the Shackle]], [[Divinity/Fiends/The Harlequin|the Harlequin]], [[Divinity/Fiends/The Hooded|the Hooded]] and [[Divinity/Fiends/The Loam|the Loam]] serve. It is shown as one eye among four hands, a hand for each prince, and the device stands above the doors of the [[Org/The Harlequins/Harlequin Town|library]] at Harlequin Town.

[[Org/The Harlequins/People/Ocelith|Ocelith]] says the eye is no person, and that it woke the four from their subservience. He is clear that it is not the [[Phenomena/Harmony/Voidsong|Voidsong]], which is a song and a different thing.
